17. §2.1 re-add on move complete: the claim that new geometry is always appended with a whole-VBO re-upload was incomplete. The normal path rewrites the plane's or wall's own zeroed slot with UploadSubData (StaticCache...cs:1360-1402). The free list (1536-1553) is used next, and append + whole-VBO re-upload only last. TODO cite 1556-1561 -> 1555-1561.
18. Absent/multithreading row "its result is not consumed by the renderer" -> its visibility result is not consumed, but its timing and seg count do feed the adaptive heuristic.

ADDITIONS (verified)
